                                "sense_id": "b7f08825-4ae4-3c04-bb00-cda874fe49e1",
                                "text": "The fear of being \"dotcommed” was a powerful catalyst creating a reactionary environment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a41522da-ed3b-4fdd-9175-c4cd8115c50b",
                                "sense_id": "b7f08825-4ae4-3c04-bb00-cda874fe49e1",
                                "text": "When will your company get dotcommed?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6b16325-bddf-4650-a240-14776dd473f5",
                                "sense_id": "b7f08825-4ae4-3c04-bb00-cda874fe49e1",
                                "text": "Then Yuppies dotcommed the Banks."
